[engl]
{100}{}{none}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Begin}
{2000}{}{Need something fixed?}
{2010}{}{Can you repair my equipment?}
{2020}{}{What can you repair?}
{2030}{}{Never mind.}
{3000}{}{Weapons and armor. Has to be equipped, though. I don't work on gear stuffed in your pack.}
{3010}{}{Repair my equipped gear.}
{3020}{}{What about advanced equipment?}
{3030}{}{What about badly damaged equipment?}
{3040}{}{Maybe next time.@@Good service, maybe next time.}
{4000}{}{There's a limit to what I can handle. Bring me something too sophisticated and I'll tell you to find someone else.}
{4010}{}{Got it.}
{5000}{}{If it's too far gone, I can't save it. Once the internals are ruined, it's scrap.}
{5010}{}{Got it.}
{6000}{}{Let me have a look.}
{6010}{}{[More...]}
{6020}{}{[Wait...]}
{7000}{}{You've got nothing equipped for me to work on.}
{7010}{}{Ok, bye.}
{8000}{}{That's already in good shape. Don't waste your caps.}
{8010}{}{Ok, bye.}
{9000}{}{I can fix that. It'll cost you @lex price@ caps.}
{9010}{}{Repair it.}
{9020}{}{Too expensive...@@Never mind.}
{10000}{}{Your equipment had been restored.}
{10010}{}{Thanks for your service.}
{100000001}{}{Don't forget to unequip your weapons!}

